    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a RTS in post-apocalyptic world where the remnants of civilization are fighting a fierce battle for survival. Take control of mobile units - from soldiers to heavy helicopters - and prove that you are the strategist who can outlast the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to make quick decisions, manage resources, and coordinate strikes with split-second precision. This game will challenge even experienced commanders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A variety of combat units: infantry, armored vehicles, aviation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Complex, tactically intense gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fast and intense battles in real time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Harsh post-apocalypse atmosphere</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a RTS in post-apocalyptic world where the remnants of civilization are fighting a fierce battle for survival. Take control of mobile units - from soldiers to heavy helicopters - and prove that you are the strategist who can outlast the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to make quick decisions, manage resources, and coordinate strikes with split-second precision. This game will challenge even experienced commanders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A variety of combat units: infantry, armored vehicles, aviation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Complex, tactically intense gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fast and intense battles in real time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Harsh post-apocalypse atmosphere</p>",
